	quest.0000000000000B1E.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis bank have 9 slots and can store up to &c256 &fitems in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000B20.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis has 10 slots and stores up to &c1024 &fitems in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000B22.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis has 27 slots and stores up to &c4096 &fitems in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000B24.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis has 36 slots and stores up to &c16,384 &fitems in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000B26.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis has 54 slots and stores up to &c65,536 &fitems in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000B28.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis has 81 slots and stores up to &c262,144 &fitems in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000B2A.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis has 81 slots and can store almost &cInfinite &famount of items in each slot!"]
	quest.0000000000000F76.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThe Energizing Orb is used to craft the materials for the higher end machines."]
	quest.0027267FD98236F4.quest_desc: [
		"A machine that fransforms &esludge&r into something useful."
		""
		"When supplied with &esludge&r, obtained from the &1Plant Gatherer&r, it will generate &esomething&r"
	]
	quest.002FB4856186F7F1.quest_desc: ["All the sandwiches of &aPam's HarvestCraft&r."]
	quest.002FB4856186F7F1.quest_subtitle: "I LOVE BREAD"
	quest.01C64E1C07B8237B.quest_desc: ["Using liquid meat and an ore this machine will turn that meat into raw ore meat of that ore."]
	quest.01F94077C23EB1AE.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fYou're gonna need alot of &eCompressed Iron &fso go ahead and make a stack right now! "]
	quest.02214A119C000B9D.quest_desc: ["If it gets very hot here are all of the smoothies of &aPam's HarvestCraft&r."]
	quest.02214A119C000B9D.quest_subtitle: "Head freezer"
	quest.0243246953371F59.quest_desc: [
		"This module doesn't actually manipulate items, but instead detects specific items in the router's buffer."
		""
		"If the buffer contents are matched by the module's filter, it will make the router emit a redstone signal in the configured direction, or all directions if the configured direction is None."
		""
		"The signal level (default: 15) and signal type (default: weak) can be adjust via the module GUI."
	]
	quest.025EE85BB25CB285.quest_desc: ["You can trash Energy !"]
	quest.0294664AB245A1A1.quest_desc: ["{chapter.useful.quest.2.description}"]
	quest.0294664AB245A1A1.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.2.subtitle}"
	quest.0294664AB245A1A1.title: "{chapter.useful.title.1}"
	quest.02CC80C4C5E7D553.quest_desc: ["A machine used to &echop&r trees and &eharvest&r crops. Each operation creates a little bit of &1Sludge&r"]
	quest.02D6C7BB7BDE4642.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fIt's time to make a mob farm!"]
	quest.02D6C7BB7BDE4642.title: "Sword"
	quest.0330063F67B18137.quest_desc: ["It places blocks."]
	quest.033B301D67E728B4.quest_desc: ["This module scans for dropped items in a 13x13x13 cubic area around the router, and absorbs them into the router's buffer, if possible."]
	quest.03E24A59CC0B87DF.quest_desc: [
		"This augment can only be added to a Vacuum Module."
		""
		"When this augment is added, the Vacuum Module will absorb experience orbs instead of items."
		""
		"The orbs will be converted into Bottles o' Enchanting at the rate of 7XP per bottle"
	]
	quest.040CF734DB19F901.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThis is the first part of the storage of the &cOccultism&r mod."
		"You might want to fusion it with a &cCrystal Matrix&r to start storing things in it."
	]
	quest.040CF734DB19F901.quest_subtitle: "Storage Basics"
	quest.040CF734DB19F901.title: "Storage Actuator Base"
	quest.042DDB1FDAA0645F.quest_desc: [
		"While Item Routers can't handle fluids directly, they can manipulate fluids if there is a fluid container item in the buffer."
		""
		"This includes buckets and any fluid containers added by other mods."
	]
	quest.043E26B2D749BB66.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has more filtering options - match by item/mod/tags, match nbt, match damage and 16 slots that can be used to filter."]
	quest.04CD419F2D4AB1D0.quest_desc: [
		"Sometimes, the &6creation&r of certain living creatures would be of use any slightly gruesome botanist"
		""
		"For this, the &5Altar of Birthing&r can be used:"
		""
		"It can create and spawn almost any &6living creature&r at the cost of some ingredients that are related to that very creature and a bit of &2Aura&r from the environement."
		""
		"For it to work, it requires the right structure to be assembled as well as the usage of a &5Spririt of Birthing&r as follow:"
		""
		"All ingredients, including the &5Spirit of Birthing&r, are required to be thrown down on the ground close to the &5Altar of Birthing&r and the process will begin automatically."
	]
	quest.04FBA4827CB2CF54.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fI highly recommend you to make use of this &cContainment Ritual &fIt can be used to farm many types of mobs and animals! Do use the &cWorn Notebook &fto find out how to use it!"]
	quest.05667EA6D3F65BD1.quest_desc: ["Pumps experience between Tank upgrade and player."]
	quest.05CF0E1BB3279BB2.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fBuilding a &cSquid&r farm might be a good idea ! "]
	quest.05CF0E1BB3279BB2.quest_subtitle: "Squids? Where !?"
	quest.05E92D8B7478247F.quest_desc: ["Entangled Binder Allows you to control what blocks bind together!"]
	quest.060FE76E8FA55A0D.quest_desc: ["Kills all mobs on the block in front of it. &dCreates liquid Meat and Pink Slime&r, but does &1not store or drop experience or mob drops&r. Requires power."]
	quest.074EF4BDC0439C58.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cDimensional Mineshaft&r allow the player to auto mine ores like the &cLaser Drill&r."
		"Put either the &cFoliot Miner&r or &cDjinni Miner&r in the &cDimensional Mineshaft's&r GUI and it'll start to mine ores. "
		"For your information, &cThe Djinni Miner&r will have a lesser durability but will mine more rare ores than the &cFoliot Miner&r."
	]
	quest.074EF4BDC0439C58.quest_subtitle: "Auto Miner"
	quest.074EF4BDC0439C58.title: "Dimensional Mineshaft"
	quest.075E58D8F753CAAB.quest_desc: [
		"The Infinity Backpack is a tool that allow you to store big amounts of items in a portable way."
		""
		"It can hold 3 specific fluids:"
		"&ebiofuel&r to allow automatic operations to fonction,"
		"&eessence&r from the picked up experience,"
		"and &eliquid meat&r to feed you automatically."
		""
		"When &eMagnet Mode&r is enabled nearby item will be teleported to the player when they can be picked up."
		""
		"When &eAuto-Pickup Mode&r is enabled item that can go in the backpack picked up by the player it will go into the backpack automatically."
		""
		"Each slot can be configured to &evoid&r excess or to &erefill&r stacks that aren't full in your inventory."
	]
	quest.077F54E23DB98DAE.quest_desc: [
		"This module tries to pull the first eligible item from the adjacent inventory in its configured direction into the router's buffer."
		""
		"If the buffer is full or contains something that stacks with nothing in the inventory, nothing will be pulled."
	]
	quest.07DC4BD11C0B2A07.quest_desc: ["Can you get to 500 Hours?"]
	quest.0990C82D9CE73CAF.quest_desc: [
		"A powerfull machine used to craft material using up to &e8&r item and/or &e1&r fluid. This machine can produce items and/or fluids."
		""
		"All the recipe are shapeless meaning that the ingredients can be in any slot."
	]
	quest.0A56663F2AFCD35A.quest_desc: [
		"Only allows this on one level so no backpack in backpack in backpack."
		""
		"Upgrades in these backpacks will also work so you can have for example pickup upgrade in one of these picking up items directly into it."
		""
		"Upgrades in the main backpack can access inventory of the subbackpacks and there's an option that defines whether they use inventory in subbackpacks first or the main one first."
		""
		"Filter upgrade in subbackpacks can be used to limit what items get inserted / pulled from them."
		""
		"Backpacks in backpack can be open using open backpack keybind when cursor is over them."
	]
	quest.0D3B8B4F7D0B9893.quest_desc: ["{chapter.useful.quest.5.description}"]
	quest.0D3B8B4F7D0B9893.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.5.subtitle}"
	quest.0DD31C0C3353544A.quest_desc: [
		"        Welcome to TJP Endless Sky 1!&r"
		"&e[&f!&e] &fIn Endless Sky 1 Progression and automation is everything."
		""
		"You will be facing many challenges that will make you want to quit."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fBut don't worry you will get some good stuff later in the game!"
		""
		"Have fun and don't &crage quit"
		"&7- MrEizy, TJP Team"
	]
	quest.0DD31C0C3353544A.quest_subtitle: "&7Quickly, claim your starter kit!"
	quest.0DFF62AA3CC689C7.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fWhen you throw a &cDiamond&r in the &cSpiritfire&r it transform it into the &cSpirit Attuned Gem&r."]
	quest.0DFF62AA3CC689C7.quest_subtitle: "A new &5Diamond&r"
	quest.0E924CB5C7EF54B2.quest_desc: ["Turns liquid Biofuel into power. Liquid Biofuel can be obtained using a Bioreactor"]
	quest.0F0E70D72860939D.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo research and begin upgrading all the Relics you find on your adventure, simply hold &c[SHIFT]&r while hovering over them in your inventory."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThis will let you read what the Relic does and what you can do to upgrade it further."
	]
	quest.0F0E70D72860939D.title: "Info on relics!"
	quest.0F5850ECC2385A6D.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade can only filter by item and has 9 filter slots."]
	quest.0FE5FF6916A0EAAD.quest_desc: [
		"3 furnaces in 1."
		""
		"Returns &e2mb&r of essence per item melted."
	]
	quest.0FE9786F86D02B3D.quest_desc: [
		"This upgrade only affects the Fluid Module."
		"It increases the overall fluid transfer rate of the Item Router from the base rate of 50mB/tick by 10mB/tick, up to a maximum of 400mB/tick."
		""
		"Therefore the maximum useful number of Fluid Transfer Upgrades in a router is 35."
	]
	quest.1039943B139AA801.quest_desc: ["Blasting ores and metal stuff in an upgrade tab."]
	quest.1074EAA509CF1984.quest_desc: ["Fragility and Death."]
	quest.111FCE085D6AC550.title: "The Crimson Altar"
	quest.1131683F9811C282.quest_desc: ["Kills all mobs on the block in front of it. Stores their drops in its inventory and converts the experience into liquid Essence"]
	quest.122948B8A9B72C20.quest_desc: [
		"This upgrade is used to guarantee that two or more routers run at the same time."
		""
		"The Sync Upgrade has a tuning value of 0 .. 19 (i.e. 1 less than the base router tick rate of 20)."
		""
		"This tuning value can be set by right-clicking the Sync Upgrade to open its GUI, or quickly set to a random value by sneak-right-clicking the upgrade."
	]
	quest.12465B84F7CA88D4.quest_desc: ["Charges items that can hold power. It charges &einfinity&r items very fast."]
	quest.12BE7267252FCE66.quest_desc: ["A machine used to collect &1Sewage&r from animals and experience to turn int into essence."]
	quest.1370BBF5313E89CB.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e]&f Meshes can be enchanted with &bFortune &fFor more drops! and &eEfficiency &fTo speed it up!"]
	quest.13D134D9CECC9EFA.quest_desc: ["This item represent the transience and falling."]
	quest.1501D2169447A969.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThis machine when combined with power and &ewater&r (or &elava&r for nether crops) it will speed up growth crop a bit."
		""
		"By providing very small amouts of &1Ether Gas&r crops will grow much faster and they will be replanted automatically."
	]
	quest.151C234E8E89D188.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.151C234E8E89D188.quest_subtitle: "The Best Part! "
	quest.152062D1417A8259.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fUpgrades for Automatic Hammer and Sieve"]
	quest.156E2E3915698AB4.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThink of it like the mod Baubles, allowing you to equip certain items to maybe gain abilities or to equip backpacks, etc."
		" "
		"You will notice while playing that some items have a tooltip displaying that they can be equipped in the Curios Menu."
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe Curios GUI menu can be access by clicking the Coin like icon top left in your inventory. Next to your character."
	]
	quest.156E2E3915698AB4.quest_subtitle: "&7Curios information"
	quest.16A90327DF9B56C1.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fA pro tip from 1 modded player to another. Make compressed versions of the block and hammer them."
		"They will turn into the compressed version of the block it hammers it too!"
	]
	quest.17491792EA1EFC9C.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fOnce we have an &eIsotopic Centrifuge&r, we can run our &eUranium Hexafluoride&r in and create &eFissile Fuel&r!"]
	quest.1777BCC30875AC66.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fIn order to get pebbles you just &eShift + Right-Click &fthe dirt!"]
	quest.187855ECC5C66261.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Winter's Calling&r brings this occurence back by causing snow to fall in a vast area around it, provided a little bit of &aAura&r."
		""
		"Additionally, water will freeze into ice and very occasionally, snow golems will spawn to help with covering the lands."
		""
		"To get this process going, a &6redstone signal&r needs to be supplied."
		""
		"The higher the strength of the signal, the biger the area in which snow will fall."
	]
	quest.1A5CD3B8C88C2F76.quest_desc: ["This machine, when provided with power, charges the first &1Ore Laser Base&r and &1fluid Laser base&r that finds in its working area."]
	quest.1AC29AFD6A527BFC.quest_desc: ["The &5Energetic Aura Forge&r directly converts &2Aura&r into what is known to most people as &6Redstone Flux&r."]
	quest.1C8E72FDD4811D75.quest_desc: ["Right click in the overworld"]
	quest.1C92C039A504D3B9.quest_desc: ["Using fermented ore meat and sand this machine will turn that meat into dust from the ore that it was first created."]
	quest.1CD0CBB8131F0E1C.quest_desc: [
		"This augment can be added to any module. Normally, modules are run when the router runs, no questions asked."
		""
		"However, if this augment is added to a module, that module can define its own redstone behaviour; an extra button is added to the module's GUI to control this."
	]
	quest.1DC99012B697B393.quest_desc: [
		"This top-end sender module operates very much like the Mk2 Sender, but can send to any inventory (in any dimension) with no restrictions!"
		""
		"Note: the target inventory must be chunk-loaded; Modular Routers will not do this for you."
	]
	quest.1E0E37433EDFD597.quest_desc: ["Break any block in front of it and places it in the internal inventory, at the cost of &e1000&rRF per operation."]
	quest.1E337423472D7C43.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cAbra's Open Conjure&r allows you to summon an &cAfrit Spirit&r. Beware ! This will not be easy, so be prepared to fight it."
		"To build this ritual you can use the &cDictionary of Spirits&r."
		""
		"Here are the needed ingredients below :"
		"- 8 &cCandles&r."
		"- 2 &cSkeletons Skulls&r."
		"- 2 &cWither Skeletons Skulls&r."
		"- 4 &cSacrifical Bowls&r."
		"- Your &cWhite&r and &cPurple&r Chalks to draw symbols on the ground."
		"- The &cGolden Sacrifical Bowl&r."
	]
	quest.1E337423472D7C43.quest_subtitle: "Afrit's Spawning Ritual"
	quest.1E337423472D7C43.title: "Abra's Open Conjure"
	quest.1F6C68FC5931B312.quest_desc: [
		"A machine that generates &ewater&r from surrounding sourceblocks."
		""
		"When adjacent to at least &e2 water source blocks&r, it will start working."
	]
	quest.1FC6AEFF048EBA9C.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade can only filter by item and has 9 filter slots."]
	quest.209DE424F426C49F.quest_desc: ["This machine mixes primal dye colours to create the colours of the raindow."]
	quest.211C506C15AB579C.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fEasy to craft just drop 2x Iron blocks and 1 flint mesh in water and the fairy will give you Iron mesh back!"]
	quest.21B39EFA98CC927C.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has more filtering options - match by item/mod/tags, match nbt, match damage and 16 slots that can be used to filter."]
	quest.227ABB042FCE13AE.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThe First component to the &cOtherworld Goggles&r"]
	quest.227ABB042FCE13AE.quest_subtitle: "No more Fruit"
	quest.227ABB042FCE13AE.title: "Infused Lenses"
	quest.22EFAA1868522D03.quest_desc: [
		"This module tries to drop an item from the router's buffer as an item entity in the world. "
		""
		"The drop will be adjacent to the router in the module's configured direction."
		""
		"The item entity will be placed with a zero velocity, unlike the vanilla Dropper which adds an irritating random velocity to the item."
	]
	quest.23728F9B42AE8BFB.quest_desc: ["This module tries to send an item from the router's buffer to an inventory in the module's configured direction."]
	quest.23A49D6344786D2A.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cStrigeors Higher Binding&r allows to craft some better items for your &cOccultism&r gameplay."
		"To build this ritual you can use the &cDictionary of Spirits&r."
		""
		"Here are the needed ingredients below :"
		"- 4 &cCandles&r."
		"- 4 &cSpirits Attuned Crystals&r."
		"- 4 or more &cSacrifical Bowls&r."
		"- The &cGolden Sacrifical Bowl&r."
		"- Your &cWhite&r, &cGold&r and &cPurple&r Chalks to draw symbols on the ground."
	]
	quest.23A49D6344786D2A.quest_subtitle: "Even better items "
	quest.23A49D6344786D2A.title: "Strigeors Higher Binding"
	quest.23FBB58702F7C693.quest_desc: ["Using raw ore meat this machine will seal its contents when reached the configured level and it will ferment that meat using the selected production type."]
	quest.242069899D14A2DF.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cDictionary of Spirits&r will allow you to have more informations about the &cOccultism&r mod ."
		"With that book you'll be able to build correctly the rituals that are asked in the quests."
		"You can click on the eye to see the needed ritual."
	]
	quest.242069899D14A2DF.quest_subtitle: "Ingame Wiki "
	quest.24BA56063B821D2B.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fBy doing this ritual you can summon the &cAfrit Spirit&r."
		"To summon it you will need to &cSacrifice&r a &cCow&r"
	]
	quest.24BA56063B821D2B.quest_subtitle: "Boss: Be prepared"
	quest.24BA56063B821D2B.title: "Afrit Essence"
	quest.24E42EC0C5B00885.quest_desc: ["When provided with power this machine will &6freeze &fand &6heal &fany entity that are in its working area."]
	quest.25D1C06635013827.quest_desc: ["An automatic vanilla brewer"]
	quest.25DD5E2E07E4EB1A.quest_desc: ["Dropping an &5Ender Eye&r on the ground close to it will cause the rose to consume it and start dispersing its &2Aura&r into the environment."]
	quest.264E33238FD5C2AC.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.268ABD1643F1BEC5.quest_desc: [
		"They have found that &aAura&r might be capable of purifying any kind of &6ore&r to a point where it has a chance of producing &6two ingots&r rather than one."
		""
		"&5Armorer's Aid&r, which simply has to be placed on top of a &5Blast Furnace&r."
	]
	quest.2708CCE704A1ECC0.quest_desc: [
		"The required &5Spirit of Birthing&r can be obtained easily by a person &6breeding&r two passive animals together while there is a(slight) exess of &2Aura&r present in the surrounding area."
		""
		"For each new baby born, there is a chance of a few &5Spirits of Birthing&r to be created in the process."
	]
	quest.27CB918318AD3C22.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fHere I have a tip for everyone. Before mining anything."
		"Mine 2 logs and then make a crafting table and after a crook then mine the leaves!"
	]
	quest.27CB918318AD3C22.title: "Getting wood!"
	quest.2804BCCAD143FCEB.quest_desc: ["{chapter.useful.quest.6.description}"]
	quest.2804BCCAD143FCEB.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.6.subtitle}"
	quest.283FB1B9E64ABF66.quest_desc: ["Bonemeals crops directly in front of it when supplied with fertilizer (bonemeal)."]
	quest.2858055FBC293F6B.quest_desc: ["With the Market you can buy every natural seeds, saplings, flowers from every mods."]
	quest.2861F95F882CD8B2.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo create a custom Portal, place down a single Teleporter block. Connect power to the block."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fCreate a Portal Frame with the teleporter block being the base of the portal."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe final product will be a 4x3 portal structure, with the two blocks in the middle creating the portal."
	]
	quest.29508BCD0282B6B6.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fWith that brand new &6Golden Chalk&r you will be able to perform better and more dangerous &crituals!"]
	quest.29508BCD0282B6B6.quest_subtitle: "Golden Rituals"
	quest.29C10B36B7B5D130.quest_desc: [
		"This dangerous module permanently destroys items in the router's buffer!"
		""
		"It is strongly recommended to configure this module with a Whitelist to prevent accidental deletion of valuable items..."
	]
	quest.2B4192D90D8DB5E6.quest_desc: [
		"To get into first contact with the substance's powers, one is required to create a &dBrilliant Tree&r that will, when harvested, shed &dGold Leaf&r - a delicate, yet powerful material."
		""
		"To create such a tree, simply craft bit of &dBrilliant Fiber&r and place it into the crown of a tree."
		""
		"Time will then bring brilliance."
	]
	quest.2B6D5FE833D6E5FE.quest_desc: [
		"The strength of any shot &6projectiles&r is, in some instances, strong enough to pierce living beings and even move them around by way of teleportation."
		""
		"For this, different kinds of projectiles produce different amouts - a &dsnowball&r is much less riche in energy than, say, an &dender pearl&r."
		""
		"However, this power can be used to create &aAura&r as well: The &dShooting Mark&r converts the energy of any projectiles shot at it into &aAura&r that it spreads into the environment."
	]
	quest.2BDE424BFF98B431.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 - 2x."]
	quest.2BF9345C462B4E5B.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis will be the main multiblock of &ePneumaticcraft&f! this is also what you need to progress to better machinery!"]
	quest.2BF9345C462B4E5B.title: "Pressure Chamber"
	quest.2C1E7F68611F16D6.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Amulet of Wrath&r, when held anywhere in the inventory, allows its wearer to focus their power, giving them the ability to, when &6sneaking&r and &6jumping&r in place, stomp down on the ground hard enough to create a &5shockwave&r that hurts any other living creatures close by. "
		""
		"This, of course, come at the cost of some &2Aura&r, stored in the form of, say, an &1Aura Cache&r."
	]
	quest.2CFB31CFACB54C1E.quest_desc: ["Tier max of the machine frame"]
	quest.2D4224644051EE7A.quest_desc: ["Main Desserts ! Beware of the sugar !"]
	quest.2D4224644051EE7A.quest_subtitle: "Not good for your diet"
	quest.2D4224644051EE7A.title: "Desserts"
	quest.2D67297B7C15CBD8.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fYou can make clay with barrel mixing check &eJEI &fis always useful!"]
	quest.2D82A80CA9A03328.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fIn order to mine &cIesnium Ores&r you will have to craft this wand."
		""
		"First you will have to setup your wand to find &cIesnium Ores&r to do so, simply right click with your wand on a Netherrack. "
		""
		"Once that's done you will have to right click with your &cDivination Wand&r to search &cIesnium Ore&r. Once your wand has found an &cOre&r, you can see it through the floor as it is highlighted."
		""
		"Note that you will need the &cOtherworld Vision&r to see the &cOre&r and the &cInfused Pickaxe&r to mine the &cIesnium Ore&r."
	]
	quest.2D82A80CA9A03328.quest_subtitle: "See Iesnium"
	quest.2DB213CC142B7471.quest_desc: [
		"{chapter.useful.torch.description.1}"
		""
		"{chapter.useful.torch.description.2}"
	]
	quest.2DB213CC142B7471.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.torch.subtitle}"
	quest.2DC67FADD37722AD.quest_desc: [
		"Pumps fluids between Tank upgrade and adjacent blocks."
		"Works with fluid containers in hand and fluid blocks in world."
		"allow to filter which fluids are pumped."
	]
	quest.2DE45C592C57D462.quest_desc: ["&2Harvests resources&r from animals on the block in front of it. This includes shearing sheep, milking cows, and collecting ink sacs from squid.&3Does not require tools to do these actions&r."]
	quest.2EC32E46525E3E08.quest_desc: [
		"A great source of natural &2Aura&r is the &6moss&r on any type of mossy block. this property can be made use of in the form of the &5Swamp Homi&r: It will take any block around it that are covered in moss and remove it, leaving the clean block behind."
		""
		"For each block that it does this with, it generates a bit of &2Aura&r and spreads it into the environment."
	]
	quest.2FAA582C635713A7.quest_desc: ["The &6Extraneous Firestarter&r is a way of using Aura to your benefit: It collects it from the world and powers a furnace without needing any fuel."]
	quest.305EE90B1032BA75.quest_desc: [
		"Be careful, it uses a lot of aura!"
		""
		"Infinite water !"
	]
	quest.30905843166E7619.quest_desc: ["Explosiveness, Fire and Dark."]
	quest.3091C2E6CA706531.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThis is the Fission Reactor which will be used to create a mass amount of steam and Nuclear waste that will be used to make &ePlutonium &fand &ePolonium &fpellets! &c(&eThey are very important both of them you should setup a factory only for producing both&c)"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fYou are going to need alot of Fissile Fuel"
	]
	quest.30C48A7DE3117D33.quest_desc: ["Place down a Tree Fluid Extractor. Place any type of log in front of the face with the animation. The Tree Fluid Extractor will slowly consume the log, turning it into liquid latex."]
	quest.30EBB2AD6DA910ED.quest_desc: [
		"Smoking food in an upgarde tab"
		"Automatically pulls/pushes items."
	]
	quest.319ED8D885766556.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThis is what you need to get started with crafting in &ePneumaticcraft&f!"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fYou're gonna need atleast 3 of these so stack up!"
	]
	quest.32A6022FC30307FE.quest_desc: [
		"The Infinity Saw is a tool that allows you to chop trees efficiently, the bigger the tier the more blocks you can chop at the same time."
		"Keep breaking the same block to chop big trees."
	]
	quest.32C75A04DF24D51F.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has more filtering options - match by item/mod/tags, match nbt, match damage and 16 slots that can be used to filter."]
	quest.32E2F6F68434B61E.quest_desc: ["A machine used to spawn withers. When provided with power, &e3 Wither Skulls&r and &e4 soulsand&r, it will completely build the wither spawning structure in the working area."]
	quest.3309F94E9DCF87FF.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fYou've probably heard people talk about how the &eFusion Reactor&r is the best power source in the pack. They are right. "
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fOnce activated, the Reactor can push out up to 200MRF/t with the right setup. It can also be cooled with water to produce steam, which can go into an &eIndustrial Turbine&r to make even more power."
	]
	quest.337BDECC78DEE734.quest_desc: ["Replaces part of backpack's inventory with fluid storage."]
	quest.340EE143C784BA64.quest_desc: ["Locate End City."]
	quest.35865423E1D69EAD.quest_desc: ["Has filters to allow limiting what food items should be fed to player (pretty useful in case you're picking up stuff like rotten flesh and similar with negative effects)."]
	quest.362BCE3E9575463F.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fIn this pack FTBTeams is inside which will allow you to make teams and share quests!"
		""
		"To make a team you just press this button in your inventory! &e[&fIt's located in the top left of your inventory!&e]"
		"{image:ftbteams:textures/teams.png width:50 height:50 align:center}"
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThis button will also allow you to invite other players or join other players parties!"
	]
	quest.371989A7DA01B703.quest_desc: [
		"After spawning &8Possessed Skeleton&r, you will now be able to spawn &0Possessed Wither Skeletons&r. "
		"To activate this ritual you will have to sacrifice a &6Villager&r or a &6Player&r."
	]
	quest.371989A7DA01B703.quest_subtitle: "The Army of the Night"
	quest.371989A7DA01B703.title: "Possessed &0Wither Skeletons"
	quest.374CA064564E5B7C.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fEasy way to get cobble and other reasources. Just press \"U\" on this item when crafted to see how to use!"]
	quest.374CA064564E5B7C.title: "Cobble Generator"
	quest.377381E839A4C259.quest_desc: [
		"Collecting items using &5Hoppers&r is useful, but sometimes, it can be inconvenient, especially if given a big area that one has to collect items in."
		""
		"For that, the &5Hopper Enhancement&r will be a help:"
		"By simply placing it on top of any &5Hopper&r, it will increase its range of picking up items drastically by about &6seven&r blocks."
		""
		"When collecting an item, it then uses a small amount of &2Aura&r."
	]
	quest.37835F8EBFC2056D.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThrow Andesite into the &cSpiritfire&r."]
	quest.37835F8EBFC2056D.quest_subtitle: "Another World"
	quest.3805B08C81BEA8A0.quest_desc: ["Main Toastes of &aPam's HarvestCraft&r."]
	quest.3805B08C81BEA8A0.quest_subtitle: "I do like bread yes"
	quest.381803EE8699CA9E.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo get Hydrogen Chloride for our machines, we'll need to first create &eBrine&r."
		""
		"To do this, we'll need a Thermal Evaporation Plant. This is a multi-block structure."
		""
		"Pump in water, and you'll start collecting brine, which can be pumped into an &eElectrolytic Separator&r to extract &eChlorine&r from the gas."
	]
	quest.386EB5512AADF487.quest_desc: ["When provided with &1Sewage&r this machine will create &1Fertilizer&r from it."]
	quest.38D2E67E3EAF0C45.title: "Sleeping Bag"
	quest.391107A056C2B88D.title: "Drawer 2x2"
	quest.3912755F95BE2CDF.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Ender Ocular&r is, to put it simply, a handheld version of the &1Ender Crate&r."
		""
		"After giving it an &6Ender Name&r the exact sam way, interacting with it while holding it in one's hand will open the storage then and there."
		""
		"For this, an &1Aura Cache&r is required that some &2Aura&r will be drained from."
	]
	quest.396672303213A8F3.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fNow &cThe Dead King &fis 1 of the important mobs you need to &ckill&f!"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo summon &cThe Dead King &fYou have to use combination crafting from &bExtended Crafting&f"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fI would also recommend you to read up on how to use the &eContainment Ritual &ffrom &cArs Nouveau&f! As it will allow you to farm all the mobs!"
	]
	quest.39CE2D3196951E55.quest_desc: [
		"The Infinity Hammer is a tool that allows you damage enemies in an area. Increasing the tier will give you access to different level of &eBeheading&r, allowing you to get mob heads easily."
		""
		"When right clicked into the ground it will make a &eshatter&r effect into the ground in a cone shape in front of the user."
	]
	quest.3A1F57CF67C4DBFE.quest_desc: [
		"&5Ender Chests&r are great technology for anyone trying to store items safely, however, they don't provide easy means of &6transportation&r for said items."
		""
		"For this, the &5Ender Crate&r is perfect:"
		"Two or more of these crates which are linked together share the same inventory, event interdimensionally, meaning that they create the possibility of easily transporting items around."
		""
		"To link one or more crates, they have to be given an &5Ender Name&r by placing them in an &6anvil&r with an &5Ender Eye&r and then writing down the desired name."
		""
		"If the worry exists that other people might call their crates the same name, any name can be &6locked&r from being given simply by placing a &1Token of Terror&r inside a crate with that name."
	]
	quest.3A610D5177B9B690.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThe first part of the White Chalk is needed to be thrown in the &cSpiritfire&r."]
	quest.3A610D5177B9B690.quest_subtitle: "The wand choose its sorcerer."
	quest.3A6F0CC2918F2E22.quest_desc: [
		"Imbued with unknow technology, this block will spawn &emob&r at a fast rate when certain condition are met."
		""
		"Firstly it requires &e1000RF&r and &e20mb&r of &eLiquid Meat&r per operation, secondly normal mob spawn condition have to be met (this means the light level has to be &e7&r or lower and the block has to be loaded)"
	]
	quest.3C0C25F26BED0E21.quest_desc: [
		"Using the &eMycelial Network&r (A subspace domain containing a living vegetable mass of fungus called the mycelium"
		"This reactor can detect the other &eMycelial generator&r and generate massive amount of FE."
	]
	quest.3C12F011AC8065E3.quest_subtitle: "Lava's Best Friend"
	quest.3C858E5CA6631D63.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis &cSuprisingly Substantial Satchel&r can hold 117 stacks of items, be carefull to not fill it with garbage."]
	quest.3C858E5CA6631D63.quest_subtitle: "Large backpack"
	quest.3C858E5CA6631D63.title: "Suprisingly Substantial Satchel"
	quest.3C94B10599956154.quest_desc: ["Locate Nether Fortress."]
	quest.3D1D2FE449747BE0.quest_desc: [
		"Integration with crafting tweaks and mouse tweaks."
		""
		"Also has performance enhancements that make it faster in crafting than vanilla workbench."
	]
	quest.3DCED36AC1A645B5.quest_desc: ["This upgrade can be used to suppress sounds and particle effects made by item routers, and can be useful if a noisy module is regularly running in a place where a player often is."]
	quest.3DE6B26FAF4BD237.quest_desc: [
		"This module behaves like the dropper module, except that it also imparts a configurable velocity to the dropped item, potentially throwing the item a considerable distance."
		""
		"You can adjust the item's speed, pitch and yaw via the module's GUI."
	]
	quest.3E46BFE9CD66C880.quest_desc: [
		"When working with &2Aura&r, sometimes it can be beneficial to know about its levels in an area without having to be there to check in person."
		""
		"The &5Aura Detector&r gives out a &6redstone&r signal based on the amout of &2Aura&r in the close vicinity around it, so long as you attach a &5Comparator&r to it."
		""
		"For that, its range of display is similar to that of the &1Environmental Eye&r."
	]
	quest.3E7DF156E952E88C.quest_desc: ["This machine can extract enchantments from items when provided with a book."]
	quest.3EC0A5BF60072E2F.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e]&f Better cobble generators! to use right click with a block shown in JEI of the cobblegen onto the cobble gen then put water and (or) lava next to it!"]
	quest.3EFB4F3BDAFB9CE6.quest_desc: ["Turns &9wooden items and blocks&r into power. The rates are identical to those of the Petrified Fuel Generator."]
	quest.3F134853F9111E68.quest_desc: ["It drains a fluid source block in front of it."]
	quest.401C5E5E7E9CC7CB.quest_desc: ["A machine used to separate &ebaby&r animals from adult animals. Baby animals will be teleported to the back of the machine. You can change what type of mobs get moved in the GUI."]
	quest.408BEB52388254EB.quest_desc: [
		"&6Slimes&r and &6Magma Cubes&r are peculiar beings."
		""
		"Upon being hurt enough, the &6split&r into smaller version of themselves, similarly to how cells multiply in the body"
		""
		"It should also be noted that, while the &dOffshoot Observer&r is in the process of dispering &aAura&r, causing an additional creature to split will not cause any more &aAura&r to be created."
	]
	quest.40C1106A575B842B.title: "Drawer 1x1"
	quest.41193073A44A79EA.quest_desc: [
		"This augment can be added to any module which has a range (Sender Mk1/Mk2, Puller Mk1/Mk2, Extruder Mk1/Mk2, Vacuum)."
		""
		"It can be stacked; each augment will reduce the range of the module by one block."
		""
		"This is probably only useful in conjunction with the Vacuum Module, to control the range it scans for items."
	]
	quest.412272889C4120C4.quest_desc: ["Consumes liquid Essence to add enchantments to items. Can only add level 30 enchantments, with each enchantment costing 3 buckets of liquid Essence. Requires power."]
	quest.4142B2FB9C7FA145.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fLink to another Bank to access the contents in multiple places at the same time."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fHow? Craft a Bank Link with the Bank you want to link it to (don't worry it won't be consumed)."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fNow place the Bank inside of a Bank Dock and you can access your items on the go and stash away items with ease!"
	]
	quest.41898B48517C3297.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fNow &cNecromancer &fis another important mob you need to &ckill&f!"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo summon &cNecromancer &fYou have to use combination crafting from &bExtended Crafting&f"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fI would also recommend you to read up on how to use the &eContainment Ritual &ffrom &cArs Nouveau&f! As it will allow you to farm all the mobs!"
	]
	quest.421DDFD7CCD8A4EE.quest_desc: ["{chapter.useful.quest.3.description}"]
	quest.421DDFD7CCD8A4EE.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.3.subtitle}"
	quest.43013BA1107142E0.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fAs same as the Impure White Chalk&r you will have to throw this &6Impure Yellow Chalk&r into the &cSpiritfire&r."]
	quest.43013BA1107142E0.quest_subtitle: "Better chalk"
	quest.43BA91382EFDF002.quest_desc: [
		"When fully charged with a &bLaser Drill &fit will drain fluids. To do it will need a specific catalyst that won't be consumed and the machine will need to be placed in a specific biome and drill at a specific depth."
		""
		"To make &bEther Gas&f, it has to be over a Wither."
		""
		"In order to keep the Wither contained, I suggest you to use &cwither proof blocks&f."
		""
		"Place the &3Stasis Chamber&r underneath the Wither to make sure it can't move anymore."
	]
	quest.440FB20FE2BE702C.quest_desc: ["Allows to play music discs in upgrade tab."]
	quest.441909867458B81A.quest_desc: [
		"This upgrade allows you to disguise the router as another block. Sneak+Right-click the module against a block to record that block on the camouflage upgrade."
		""
		"When inserted into a router, that router will take on the appearance of the recorded block."
	]
	quest.442B4A1C5ECC8476.quest_desc: ["When placed above a &ewater pool&r of at least &13×3&r and &e1&r block deep, it will start &efishing&r ans put the fish in the internal inventory, at the cost of &e5000&rRF per operation."]
	quest.44F6CBDED5C18FA2.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &f5% Drop chance from mobs"]
	quest.45375A2F7E5360A6.quest_desc: [
		"This augment can only be added to the Dropper and Flinger modules."
		""
		"It can be stacked; each augment added will increase the pickup delay on dropped/flung items by 10 ticks (0.5 sec)."
		""
		"This can be useful if you don't want players accidentally picking up nearby dropped items, for example."
	]
	quest.4641078FDD6E3595.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cEziveus' Spectral Compulsion&r allows to craft some better items for your &cOccultism&r gameplay."
		"To build this ritual you can use the &cDictionary of Spirits&r."
		""
		"Here are the needed ingredients below :"
		"- 2 &cSpirits Attuned Crystals&r."
		"- 2 &cCandles&r."
		"- 4 or more &cSacrifical Bowls.&r"
		"- Your &cWhite&r and &cGolden&r Chalks to draw symbols on the ground."
		"- The &cGolden Sacrifical Bowl&r."
	]
	quest.4641078FDD6E3595.quest_subtitle: "Better items"
	quest.4641078FDD6E3595.title: "Eziveus' Spectral Compulsion"
	quest.4679E31D0EAEF85C.quest_desc: ["This module behaves rather like the Extruder Module Mk1, but with some important differences."]
	quest.4752BE0799381B31.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fIn order to spawn those &cPossessed Skeleton&r you should do the ritual and then sacrifice a &cChicken&r near the golden bowl."]
	quest.4752BE0799381B31.quest_subtitle: "Cursed skeletons"
	quest.4752BE0799381B31.title: "Summon &8Possessed Skeleton&r"
	quest.47577A1D5FD3A9FA.quest_desc: [
		"This module tries to transfer items between the router and a player's own inventory."
		""
		"The player can be anywhere in any dimension, making this a rather powerful module."
	]
	quest.4774E5DBE97FEB16.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Mystical Magnifier&r is a neat device for any magical botanist working with machinery."
		""
		"When equipped in either hand, and interacting with a compatible device, its &6range of operation&r will be displayed around it, allowing any contraptions built with it to be inspected easily and precisely."
	]
	quest.47A262541C6569CA.quest_desc: ["Right click in the nether"]
	quest.486D752E708E00F9.quest_desc: [
		"Get can enough?? Here are the reals dishes from &aPam's HarvestCraft&r ! "
		"Bon appétit ! "
	]
	quest.486D752E708E00F9.quest_subtitle: "Happy Meals"
	quest.487D1E30DF7CC914.quest_desc: ["This machine functions the same way as an anvill but instead of experience it uses &1Essence.&r It can grab essence from the tank on top of the cost is too big."]
	quest.48933BEAA6C06E1A.quest_desc: ["Surely, at one point in their lives, any person dealing with trees was faced with this wellknow issue: An &dOak Sapling&r grows into a &6Big tree&r which is hard to look at, to manage and to chop down."]
	quest.48E4B71B64A76DCD.quest_desc: ["The Latex Processing Unit needs to be supplied with power, water, and liquid latex. Once it has all of these inputs, it will produce Tiny Dry Rubber. Put 9 Tiny Dry Rubber into a crafting grid to produce Dry Rubber."]
	quest.4924FDFE3A06F38B.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade will automatically swap right tool into player's hand from backpack when block or entity is clicked ."]
	quest.495B6600182C5479.quest_desc: ["This more powerful sender module tries to send an item from the router's buffer to a nearby inventory."]
	quest.496AB4B2F1DB6DEB.quest_desc: ["Up to 6 stacks can be defined in its filter to refill."]
	quest.499AC594CA241071.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fAutomatic Sieve"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThere is a early power setup in the &eNature's Aura&f Questline the quest is called &cEnergetic Aura Forge&f it is also the block that produces FE"
	]
	quest.49E136B1520B2146.quest_desc: ["You can trash Fluids !"]
	quest.4A47C3C6F8C08B44.quest_desc: ["You can trash everything."]
	quest.4A950435627703B1.quest_desc: [
		"First of all, a &6chorus flower&r has to be grown at most about two blocks away from it."
		"Once it has grown high enough, supplying the &5Reaper of Ender Heights&r with a &6redstone signal&r will cause it to start harvesting the entire plant, dispersing &2Aura&r in the process."
	]
	quest.4B1CADFC7A3BF0AE.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 - 8x."]
	quest.4B84F77DD98859BF.quest_desc: ["Smoking food in an upgrade tab."]
	quest.4BBF1BD5E961F66B.quest_desc: ["{chapter.useful.quest.7.description}"]
	quest.4BBF1BD5E961F66B.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.7.subtitle}"
	quest.4BCA238C4EE0BD35.quest_desc: ["Found in the &4nether&r."]
	quest.4BCA238C4EE0BD35.title: "Aura Flower"
	quest.4C3328C0818848B0.quest_desc: [
		"Duplicates &efungi&r."
		""
		"For nether fungi it needs &elava&r."
	]
	quest.4C4A63FB1B15C899.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fAs you may understand this has the same power that an &cImprisonment Tool&r."
		"You can simply capture a mob when you right click with the &cSoul Gem&r on it."
	]
	quest.4C4A63FB1B15C899.quest_subtitle: "A Demonic Imprisonment Tool"
	quest.4C4A63FB1B15C899.title: "Soul Gem"
	quest.4CEDC6946C79E792.quest_desc: ["Modules in a router operate on a single item at a time: e.g. a Sender module will send a single item from the router's buffer, regardless of how many items are in the buffer."]
	quest.4CF7A627823E69EE.title: "Hammock"
	quest.4D5B754A959FDDA9.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fEver found a specific sound that is annoying you?"
		" "
		"Simply head into your inventory and click the Muffle button top right of your character render."
		" "
		"When you've clicked it a GUI will open up and a list of recently played sounds will be displayed. Just left click the one you want to mute and then you're golden! &e(&cClick again to unmute.&e)"
	]
	quest.4D5B754A959FDDA9.quest_subtitle: "&7Read more about Sound muffling"
	quest.4E0FE273BA918875.quest_desc: ["It places fluids."]
	quest.4E8024A60B451274.quest_desc: [
		"This augment can only be added to the Vacuum Module."
		""
		"It allows the Vacuum Module to ignore the normal pickup delay on dropped items - 40 ticks for items dropped by players, and 10 ticks for items dropped by other means and pick up items as soon as it sees them."
	]
	quest.4FEC00A9C44489CF.quest_desc: ["Tier 4 - 16x."]
	quest.5007B0720DA78896.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fTo make a spirit fire simply use a flint and steel and right click any fuel block &c(I highly recommend just netherrack)"]
	quest.5007B0720DA78896.quest_subtitle: "A new kind of exchange"
	quest.5007B0720DA78896.title: "Spirit Fire"
	quest.511599B20F7EAB7E.quest_desc: [
		"By default, a router ticks every 20 server ticks, or once per second."
		""
		"On each tick, every installed module is executed in order, left to right."
	]
	quest.51430156FFFF8853.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fSave as much as possible you are gonna need it for later game."]
	quest.514ECD021EDF0591.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fYou will notice when you open a Crafting Table or similar (if supported) that there'll be 3 new buttons on the left side of the grid."
		" "
		"These buttons can be handy for either rotating around a recipe, or clearing the crafting grid fast."
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThere's also a button to evenly split a stack into every slot."
		" "
		"Give them a try!"
		" "
	]
	quest.514ECD021EDF0591.quest_subtitle: "&7Read a little about Crafting Tweaks"
	quest.51C1BD39EFFC3779.quest_desc: ["You can trash Items !"]
	quest.526CDE91E43E448B.quest_desc: [
		"The &5Firecracker Gaze&r seemingly shares this opinion especially: Consuming any fireworks that are &4dropped&r on the ground around it, it will shoot them up into the air."
		""
		"This implies that it would be wise to set up some sort of &4timer&r for its automation."
		""
		"For the complexity, especially the &6value&r of the items used in the firework's creation is of importance, but also, the amout of &6firework stars&r, the amout of &6colors&r and some other variables factor into the amout of &2Aura&r created from each shot."
	]
	quest.52A9B829A4D0206D.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fAs you may understand, this &cInfused Pickaxe&r will be able to break the &cIesnium Ore&r. Now good luck finding those..."]
	quest.52A9B829A4D0206D.quest_subtitle: "Iesnium Breaker"
	quest.52A9B829A4D0206D.title: "Infused Pickaxe"
	quest.541EB42A3502F747.title: "The adventure rails"
	quest.5458B4B77C7D8370.quest_desc: [
		"&lBinding an Entangled Block&r"
		"1. Craft an Entangled Block and an Entangled Binder"
		"2. Place down your Entangled Block"
		"3. Right-Click on the block you want to bind with the Entangled Binder"
		"4. Right-Click on your Entangled Block with the Entangled Binder"
		""
		"&lUnbinding an Entangled Block&r"
		"1. Select an empty slot on your hotbar"
		"2. Start crouching"
		"3. Right-Click on the Entangled Block"
	]
	quest.547CD5BAEBF56D49.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has more filtering options - match by item/mod/tags, match nbt, match damage and 16 slots that can be used to filter."]
	quest.5480836D0540C2F4.quest_desc: [
		"One of the two activities mosly done by humans is &6breaking&r blocks."
		""
		"This requires quite a bit of strengh and effort, and, if done for long amounts of time, can become quite tiring."
		""
		"The &5Aura Field Creator&r creates a dense field of moving &2Aura&r that is strong enough for it &6destroy blocks&r within it."
	]
	quest.54B53A39142BBA7A.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fIn order to bind your &cFoliot Book&r to your &cDictionnary of Spirits&r you'll have to put them both in your crafting table."]
	quest.54B53A39142BBA7A.quest_subtitle: "The basic summoning book"
	quest.55701B7355376249.quest_desc: [
		"The Infinity Launcher is a tool that allows you to capture or release entities from &4Mob Imprisonment Tool&r at a range."
		"When selecting the mode in the GUI and firing the launcher you will be able to release or capture mob using the &eMIT&r in your inventory."
	]
	quest.5586637C3AD7EE31.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &eSupercharged Coiles &fare placed on the &eSPS&f Port point to each other inside the multiblock, These will supercharge &ePolonium &finto &eAntimatter. "
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo produce 1mb of Antimatter, you need 400MRF. If you haven't started making a &eFusion Reactor&r, now's a good time to make it!"
	]
	quest.5588A5EE5DEAEDC3.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fQuests usually have &eLoot Crates&f, &eexperience levels&f & &eother items&f as &erewards."
		" "
		"The &eLoot Crates&f can vary a lot, maybe you'll end up getting something &ereally nice,&f &oooor&r, something &eless valuable."
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] Note: &fMods are not gated by quests. Quests are optional. It just shows how to get to the end easier."
	]
	quest.5588A5EE5DEAEDC3.quest_subtitle: "Quests"
	quest.559F61F3E7E1AA0F.quest_desc: [
		"&eChipped&r expands on the variety of blocks you can use in-game."
		""
		"The mod offers over 2000 unique building blocks."
		""
		"Chipped works in the same way as the stone cutter."
	]
	quest.560B9A1572081C79.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has 16 slots and can compact items using both 2x2 and 3x3 recipes."]
	quest.56D7BB23F08E5E21.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fYou're gonna need alot of this im sorry! To actually get this just grab a bucket filled with plastic and place the plastic fluid on a block!"]
	quest.5703BB43D271C5B5.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fYou're able to claim chunks to protect your base(s). Just click the map icon that is located top left in your inventory."
		" "
		"This will bring up a fullscreen map, but this isn't the map we're looking for. Click the map again top left corner."
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] &fHere you can freely claim available chunks by just drawing on the map with your mouse. (Left click and drag.)"
		" "
		"To unclaim a chunk you do the opposite, just draw but hold 'Right Click' instead."
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] &e[&f!&e] &f(To Chunkload a Chunk you do as explained above but now you need to hold down 'LSHIFT' while dragging over an existing claimed chunk.)"
	]
	quest.58B3C38BCA49FB74.quest_desc: ["A machine that when provided with water and some &eseeds&r,&esapplings&r,&edyes&r and &eskulls&r??? it will create &1Biofuel&r"]
	quest.58E0C3EE95D6CE26.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade can only filter by item and has 9 filter slots."]
	quest.5932F70C7B7174D6.quest_desc: ["This machine will detect how many entities are in front of it and it will emit a redstone signal in the back with the same strength as the amount of entities detected."]
	quest.593C97F1466B4214.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cDemon Seeds&r are droppable when you break &cGrass&r."
		"You can plant them in a fertile soil and let the farm begging !"
	]
	quest.593C97F1466B4214.quest_subtitle: "You can now see a new world"
	quest.597A2BFF09A9D5B6.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fFlight nearby"]
	quest.5988508903F0AA7A.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade can only filter by item and has 9 filter slots."]
	quest.5A0E2C8248383601.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 - 4x."]
	quest.5AC484ACA08DB023.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has filters which allow to filter what gets swapped."]
	quest.5B06D59E125A8E2C.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fSince I don't want you to have too much trouble."
		""
		"I made an easy farmable seed for the golden leaf!"
		""
		"Just for you! Don't tell anyone else!"
	]
	quest.5C5EE1F700AFF13A.quest_desc: [
		"As described in the &9One Creating Aura&r section, most &6creational devices&r lack the ability to create &2Aura&r beyond a certain point."
		""
		"The &dCreational Catalyst&r easily solves this problem: Placing it directly below any creational device will cause its limit to be lifted, making it able to generate &2Aura&r far beyond the previously mentioned point."
	]
	quest.5C879571A9D252AE.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fSuper Factory Manager will allow you to automate alot of stuff early on!"]
	quest.5CDD12B6597A77EE.quest_desc: [
		"The Regulator Augment allows for precise control over how many items may be sent to or pulled from an inventory, or the router's buffer."
		""
		"When a module has the Regulator Augment activated, you will see an extra numeric textfield in its GUI where you can configure a limit."
		""
		"The module's tooltip text will also show the limit."
	]
	quest.5D1ED6048FE7A389.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade only has 9 filter slots and can only compact items using 2x2 recipes."]
	quest.5DE8632986055F0E.title: "Drawer 1x2"
	quest.5EF659D081AA78A0.quest_desc: ["Killing mobs have a 15% chance to drop minium shards"]
	quest.5F2EB0170467535E.quest_subtitle: "The Devil's Son"
	quest.5F7600CB80164892.quest_desc: [
		"This module can be added to any module which handles items (as opposed to blocks or fluids)."
		""
		"Adding Stack Augments to a module increases the number of items it can process per tick; each Stack Augment doubles the number of items, up to a maximum of the item's natural stack size (64 for most items)."
	]
	quest.5FB0E87B4B124DB3.quest_desc: [
		"The Infinity Trident is a tool that allows you to release the true power of a trident."
		"Increasing the tier will give you access to different levels of &eLoyalty, Riptide&r and &eChanneling&r."
		""
		"Channeling and hit damage will be applied in aoe."
	]
	quest.6010C79321EB4D52.quest_desc: [
		"Multiplies the max stack size limit by a value."
		""
		"Tier starter tier - 1.5x."
	]
	quest.6034D6F82EB3B314.quest_desc: [
		"Blasting ores and metal stuff in an upgrade tab."
		"Automatically auto pulls/pushes items."
	]
	quest.6045E9004C76EBC9.quest_desc: ["A drill which gets upgraded as energy is put into it. The easiest way to get started charging your drill is with a Wireless Charger from the Chargers mod."]
	quest.606BD6F121A796AF.quest_desc: ["Exploration and beauty."]
	quest.60A629680966DF8A.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis will be used to transform blocks into others!"]
	quest.60D3E9EF591E6059.quest_desc: ["Regular upgrade can only filter by item and has 9 filter slots."]
	quest.6138B86CEB3E6B94.quest_desc: ["Makes backpack indestructible."]
	quest.61458FAF0B2DD408.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cHeydrin's Lure&r allows to spawn some &cPossessed Mobs&r."
		"To build this ritual you can use the &cDictionary of Spirits&r."
		"Here are the needed ingredients below :"
		"- 8 &cCandles&r."
		"- 4 or more &cSacrifical Bowls&r"
		"- Your &cWhite&r and &cGolden&r Chalks to draw symbols on the ground."
		"- The &cGolden Sacrifical Bowl&r."
	]
	quest.61458FAF0B2DD408.quest_subtitle: "Ressources on the go! "
	quest.61458FAF0B2DD408.title: "Hedryin's Lure"
	quest.61FC57098BC29ADC.quest_desc: ["{chapter.useful.quest.1.description}"]
	quest.61FC57098BC29ADC.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.1.subtitle}"
	quest.61FC5847FE175F29.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cInfused Lenses&r allow the player to have the Demon View that can offers &cThe Demon Dream Fruit&r. You will now be able to see the Otherwold stuff !"]
	quest.61FC5847FE175F29.quest_subtitle: "I see better"
	quest.625A280D9BAB39E5.quest_desc: ["The &5Ring of Last Chance&r, when placed anuwhere in the user's inventory, will prevent their death by healing them and &6disappearing&r in the process, similary to the &5Totem of Undying&r."]
	quest.629475DF40007ED1.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fSo this is your first machine that will generate air pressure for you!"
		"Although its a poor one it will due for now!"
	]
	quest.62E891A8B012DAD6.quest_desc: [
		"This module extends and withdraws a row of blocks (from the router's buffer) in the module's configured direction."
		""
		"By default, the module extends blocks when the router has a redstone signal, and withdraws them when the router has no signal, but a Redstone Enhancement can be added to the module to customise this behaviour."
		""
		"Using this module, it's possible to build large extending bridges and doorways."
	]
	quest.6321C311B46FC390.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &bTemporal Pouch &fWill help in many ways! 1 way is to speed up furnaces and machines!"
		"You can also speed up spawners!"
	]
	quest.63B23FA7CF83536B.quest_desc: ["Go to the upper tier with dissolution chamber"]
	quest.649AAA6B08377944.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.6564D7ABC303EBD7.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fI highly recommend checking &b@IntegratedDynamics &ffor the storage system early on!"]
	quest.6564D7ABC303EBD7.title: "Chest"
	quest.6593FBB2CF040863.quest_desc: ["Pumps fluids between Tank upgrade and adjacent blocks."]
	quest.65D9E0F1B657A382.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &cOsorin's Unbound Calling&r allows to spawn some &cPossessed Wither Skeletons&r. "
		"To build this ritual you can use the &cDictionary of Spirits&r."
		""
		"Here are the needed ingredients below :"
		"- 4 &cSkeletons Skulls&r."
		"- 6 &cSacrifical Bowls&r."
		"- Your &cWhite&r and &cPurple&r Chalks to draw symbols on the ground."
		"- The &cGolden Sacrifical Bowl&r."
	]
	quest.65D9E0F1B657A382.quest_subtitle: "Spooky Scary Skeletons"
	quest.65D9E0F1B657A382.title: "Osorin's Unbound Calling"
	quest.66980B529CB241FA.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fJade is the currency you use to buy items in the shop!"
		""
		"You should save up because you won't be able to craft it for a long time!"
	]
	quest.66CBFD4C91CFC831.quest_desc: [
		"Sometimes, as a farmer, one wants their &6animals&r to be contained in a small area as to prevent them from running away."
		""
		"The &5Corporeal Eye&r prevents any animals frome exiting its area of effect without needing any blocks around it."
		""
		"Its &6range&r for this containment is determined by the &6redstone signal&r applied to it - the stronger it is, the bigger the area."
	]
	quest.6721140EF437E351.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis block makes it possible to transfer everything wirelessly!"]
	quest.67B351A0FDB2F34E.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fBe sure to take advantage of the Trash Slot in your inventory."
		" "
		"The Trash Slot is really handy if you just need to get rid of items while in a hurry, or just cleaing up."
		" "
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe Trash Slot can be found in the bottom right in your inventory"
	]
	quest.67B351A0FDB2F34E.quest_subtitle: "&7The Trash Slot"
	quest.67B351A0FDB2F34E.title: "&fTrash Slot"
	quest.67BC8A5CBAF363F8.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe first ritual you will use is called &e&lRitual of The Forest&f."
		""
		"This ritual will be used up to or further then mid game!"
	]
	quest.67BC8A5CBAF363F8.title: "Ritual of The Forest"
	quest.6889B6C60E4690E6.quest_desc: [
		"{chapter.useful.quest.4.description}"
		""
		"{chapter.useful.quest.4.description.2}"
	]
	quest.6889B6C60E4690E6.quest_subtitle: "{chapter.useful.quest.4.subtitle}"
	quest.6889B6C60E4690E6.title: "{chapter.useful.title.2}"
	quest.69E09AC904A70CA8.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has more filtering options - match by item/mod/tags, match nbt, match damage and 16 slots that can be used to filter."]
	quest.6AA09AFC6FAA63DA.quest_desc: ["This upgrade makes the router fully immune to explosion damage, and also to being destroyed by boss mobs."]
	quest.6BFD839679865FFE.title: "Crystals"
	quest.6C8777B6BAE55128.quest_desc: [
		"This augment can be added to any module which has a range (Sender Mk1/Mk2, Puller Mk1/Mk2, Extruder Mk1/Mk2, Vacuum)."
		""
		"It can be stacked; each augment will increase the range of the module by one block."
	]
	quest.6CA2EE6CB0541A6F.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fNow &cAncient Knight &fis another important mob you need to &ckill&f!"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo summon &cAncient Knight &fYou have to use combination crafting from &bExtended Crafting&f"
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fI would also recommend you to read up on how to use the &eContainment Ritual &ffrom &cArs Nouveau&f! As it will allow you to farm all the mobs!"
	]
	quest.6D9986288861DD33.quest_desc: [
		"As Ashes turn to ashes, and dust to dust, a similar natural converstion can be achieved with &aAura&r and equally magic &dPotions&r."
		""
		"Specifically, &dLingering Potions&r have certain magical abilities that allow on to extract the effect and convert them into &aAura&r efficiently."
	]
	quest.6EA22A1715BFB68A.quest_desc: ["Auto smelting one will automatically pull fuel, items to smelt and will automatically push smelted items back into backpack."]
	quest.6F206C31ECDB6FCB.quest_subtitle: "Store your crafting table in your pocket."
	quest.6F206C31ECDB6FCB.title: "&#806517Handled Crafting Table&r"
	quest.6F2DA4F1995EEE12.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThis item is used to store power and works like a portable battery!"]
	quest.6F5E77909AE14928.quest_desc: ["This module tries to place an item from the router's buffer as a block, adjacent to the router in the module's configured direction."]
	quest.6FA1B1D053C2C065.quest_desc: ["Right click in the end"]
	quest.6FC97C8A57860696.quest_desc: ["A next-generation &ecobbelstone&r generator."]
	quest.6FF230B86878B633.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThe &eSupercritical Phase Shifter&r (SPS for short) is another multiblock structure used to infuse Polonium with large amounts of power to create &eAntimatter&r gas, which can be crystallized into pellets."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo build the SPS, you'll need to make a total of 72 &eSPS Casings&r, 3 &eSPS Ports&r, 122 Reactor Glass."
	]
	quest.70897A94E1945D61.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fHere is the second part of the &cDimensional Storage Actuator&r."
		"You might want to fusion it with a &cStorage Actuator Base&r to start storing things in it."
	]
	quest.70897A94E1945D61.quest_subtitle: "The other part of Storage"
	quest.70897A94E1945D61.title: "Dimensional Crystal Matrix"
	quest.70C1A8C1A4193198.quest_desc: ["This machine will sort items that are enchanted from the one that aren't."]
	quest.7230238D6F926570.quest_desc: [
		"Also remembers the last recipe used."
		""
		"If the same block is inserted it will preselect that recipe."
		""
		"So stonecutting multiple stacks of the same block is much faster."
	]
	quest.72845589E6B99367.quest_subtitle: "Unlock the main chapters of &aPam's HarvestCraft&r"
	quest.72845589E6B99367.title: "Unlocking Pam's HarvestCraft"
	quest.734A8EC986C6CC0A.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fIt's time for us to explore the world what do you say?"]
	quest.741A9BB38F47B06A.quest_desc: [
		"Over the years, magical botanists have tried to find a way to manipulate &6time&r itself for personal again."
		""
		"To set it up, all that is required is for the &dShifting Sundial&r to have an &dItem Frame&r on it containg a &dHand of Time&r."
		""
		"The &6rotation&r of the hand in the frame will then determine the time that will be skipped to, with the hand pointing to the top corresponding to midnight."
		""
		"To activate a time skip, a regular &dClock&r has to be dropped very close to the sundial."
	]
	quest.744804847D5DE61F.quest_desc: ["A machine used to &eplant&r crops and saplings."]
	quest.748B28CA71EB65FE.quest_desc: [
		"&e[&f!&e] &fThrow an Oak Sapling into the &cSpiritfire&r."
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fTo actually get the correct wood, you will have to eat a &cDemon Fruit&r to have the &cOtherworld&r vision. Be carefull though it's not definitive. "
		""
		"&e[&f!&e] &fOnce that you have that vision you will be able to farm the &cOtherwood&r ."
	]
	quest.748B28CA71EB65FE.quest_subtitle: "Am I seeing weird things?"
	quest.7591DDDBE81D6790.quest_desc: ["The Natural Altar collects Aura from the environment to use for the creation of new materials."]
	quest.7591DDDBE81D6790.title: "The Natural Altar"
	quest.7604B2A062E5C2AE.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fYou can sort any container by pressing the middle mouse button inside of it."]
	quest.7604B2A062E5C2AE.quest_subtitle: "&7Read a little about inventory sorting"
	quest.762FDE2FD8D49DEA.quest_desc: [
		"A machine used to spawn mobs."
		"When provided with power, &1Essence&r and any entity in a &1mob Imprisonment Tool&r it will spawn them around it."
	]
	quest.765761A6D78A05B0.quest_subtitle: "A better minion"
	quest.7762800EB1C60718.quest_desc: ["This can be made use of using the &5Herbivorous Absorber&r that will, when placed in the world, consume any small flower in the close vicinity and convert their energy into &2Aura&r."]
	quest.785FB30509D0502B.quest_desc: ["Advanced one has bigger magnet range more filtering options - match by item/mod/tags, match nbt, match damage and 16 slots that can be used to filter."]
	quest.789308C6D247F877.quest_desc: [
		"This upgrade, when inserted, will restrict the players who can open the router's GUI."
		""
		"By default, it only allows the player who crafted the upgrade."
	]
	quest.790AAACDB33FD517.quest_desc: [""]
	quest.7A3B4FCFD24F23A1.quest_desc: ["A platter will allow you to be auto fed by placing it down and right clicking it with food in your hand!"]
	quest.7A419FAAEDC02604.quest_desc: ["Here are the main tools for &aPam's HarvestCraft&r."]
	quest.7A419FAAEDC02604.quest_subtitle: "Might be handy !"
	quest.7A5778FFFC7DD583.quest_desc: ["&e[&f!&e] &fThe difference with the &cStable Wormhole&r is quite notable. In fact when you have this in hand, you will now be able to craft with items that are stocked in your &cDimensional Storage Actuator&r network."]
